{
  "title": "蓝色长椅",
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "line_id": "L001",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "今日はノート、ありますか。",
      "zh_CN": "今天笔记本带了吗？",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 2.4,
      "end": 7.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S01",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L002",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "あります。覚えてたんですね。",
      "zh_CN": "带了。你还记得啊。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 19.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S02",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L003",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "あの青いベンチを見ると思い出します。",
      "zh_CN": "看到那张蓝椅子就想起来。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 26.4,
      "end": 31.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S03",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L004",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "今日は雨、降らなさそう。",
      "zh_CN": "今天好像不会下雨。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 38.4,
      "end": 43.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S04",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L005",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "でも、傘を持ってきました。",
      "zh_CN": "不过我还是带了伞。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 50.4,
      "end": 55.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S05",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L006",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "用心深いですね。",
      "zh_CN": "你真谨慎。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 62.4,
      "end": 67.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S06",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L007",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "この前、少し濡れたので。",
      "zh_CN": "上次淋到一点雨。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 74.4,
      "end": 79.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S07",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L008",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "あの時、助かりました。",
      "zh_CN": "上次真的多亏你。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 86.4,
      "end": 91.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S08",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L009",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "明日も同じ時間ですか。",
      "zh_CN": "明天也这个时间吗？",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 98.4,
      "end": 103.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S09",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L010",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "たぶん。会えたら、また。",
      "zh_CN": "大概吧。遇见的话再聊。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 110.4,
      "end": 115.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S10",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    }
  ],
